        "slc_c540cd2829da51c0780d3226023fb2d17577306281631a0eda4e0892d5ba407b",
        "slc_e6fb4e78bb8000ec19caa84dd11e5ee2302569e2abb5601187e7c8c6c95a3211"
      ],
      "text": "hud drives each CLI headless through its JSON event stream (e.g. `opencode run --format json`, `claude -p --output-format stream-json`, `codex exec --json`) and resumes sessions via each engine's own resume mechanism."
    },
