          "git_sha": "a979e6a3f3c09def2703a221d13e45db0867bed8",
          "line_end": 120,
          "line_start": 114,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "adrida/hud-mode",
          "url": "https://github.com/adrida/hud-mode/blob/98571ccf71015216d34cd8f37df8bf15e7e3f1f9/README.md#L114-L120"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e6fb4e78bb8000ec19caa84dd11e5ee2302569e2abb5601187e7c8c6c95a3211"
      ],
      "text": "The full-TUI handback uses a sentinel file ~/.claude/hud/handoff.json watched by the wrapper, written per-engine via a hook, an AGENTS.md rule, or a command template."
    },
